# Raw historical photo archive (public/) — source material only, ~174 MB of
# 4608x3456 originals, including screenshots and folders such as "2021 B 1"
# whose names are not plain years. Never commit these:
# server/scripts/optimise-archive-images.mjs resizes them and
# import-archive-gallery.mjs uploads the optimised copies to Vercel Blob.
# Root-anchored so client/public (the built app's own assets) is unaffected.
/public/
